  "body": "Discover modern coastal living with this brand-new house. Perfectly designed for comfort and convenience, this home offers:\r\n\r\nHome Comforts:\r\n* 3 Double Bedrooms: Including a master suite complete with a walk-in wardrobe, private ensuite and access to the outdoor living.\r\n* 2 Contemporary Bathrooms: Finished with sleek, high-quality fittings.\r\n* Streamlined kitchen : Efficiently connects to the open-plan living area, maximizing your sense of space\r\n* Indoor-Outdoor Flow: Open-plan living and dining areas that transition seamlessly to your outdoor entertaining space.\r\n* Convenience & Security: Single internal access garage for peace of mind.\r\n* Wrap around footpath\r\n* Fully fenced if you put a gate on back stairs\r\n* 10 year Stamford warranty for peace of mind\r\n\r\nLocated in a sought-after Orewa neighbourhood, you'll enjoy being close to stunning beaches, local cafes, schools, and easy motorway access - offering the perfect balance of lifestyle and convenience.  This new development is designed for consistent quality across the development with green landscaping and public spaces enhancing family-friendly vibes.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer, downsizer, or looking for a smart investment, this property represents outstanding value.\r\n\r\nEnquire today for this home or for package options for similar homes in this location\r\n\r\nViewing access: Set GPS to Mahinga Kai Road, take 1st right (Ara Taha Cresent), 2nd left is Kopu Road.   (see map included in the pictures). Access through Flavell Drive is also now open.",
